rs that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  the results of immunohistochemical staining for progesterone receptor protein are for investigational use only  they must not be used for clinical purposes  added by  frederick carl koerner  m d  signed on  25 removed_month 94 at 08 30 gross description  received fresh in the frozen section lab   labeled remove_patient_name  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast mass   report_end  , Positive.
